{"lines": [{"text": "Forty-two billion dollars left this bank in one single day.", "start": 0.1, "end": 3.892, "spec": {"type": "hero", "title": ["$42 BILLION", "GONE IN ONE DAY"], "mood": "tense"}, "words": [["Forty-two", 0.123, 0.525], ["billion", 0.536, 0.915], ["dollars", 0.915, 1.35], ["left", 1.362, 1.663], ["this", 1.674, 1.842], ["bank", 1.841, 2.243], ["in", 2.478, 2.623], ["one", 2.623, 2.868], ["single", 2.868, 3.114], ["day", 3.114, 3.471]]}, {"text": "It was Silicon Valley Bank in California, the go-to bank for tech startups.", "start": 4.092, "end": 8.652, "spec": {"type": "map", "cam": [-98, 39, 2.0], "cam2": [-121.5, 37.0, 10], "pins": [{"at": [-121.96, 37.35], "label": "Silicon Valley Bank", "col": "red", "delay": 0.45}]}, "words": [["It", 0.08, 0.136], ["was", 0.148, 0.261], ["Silicon", 0.273, 0.693], ["Valley", 0.693, 1.034], ["Bank", 1.045, 1.375], ["in", 1.5, 1.602], ["California", 1.602, 2.261], ["the", 2.614, 2.705], ["go-to", 2.705, 2.977], ["bank", 2.977, 3.25], ["for", 3.25, 3.364], ["tech", 3.375, 3.591], ["startups", 3.602, 4.227]]}, {"text": "On March eighth, twenty twenty-three, it admitted a one-point-eight-billion-dollar loss on its bonds.", "start": 8.852, "end": 14.3, "spec": {"type": "loss"}, "words": [["On", 0.08, 0.17], ["March", 0.17, 0.477], ["eighth", 0.477, 0.784], ["twenty", 0.83, 1.057], ["twenty-three", 1.068, 1.682], ["it", 2.045, 2.136], ["admitted", 2.136, 2.443], ["a", 2.443, 2.523], ["one-point-eight-billion-dollar", 2.534, 3.955], ["loss", 3.966, 4.352], ["on", 4.364, 4.455], ["its", 4.455, 4.557], ["bonds", 4.557, 5.114]]}, {"text": "Founders panicked in group chats, and everyone pulled their money out with a few taps on their phones.", "start": 14.5, "end": 19.684, "spec": {"type": "panic"}, "words": [["Founders", 0.125, 0.443], ["panicked", 0.443, 0.818], ["in", 0.818, 0.898], ["group", 0.898, 1.17], ["chats", 1.17, 1.682], ["and", 1.898, 2.011], ["everyone", 2.011, 2.432], ["pulled", 2.443, 2.67], ["their", 2.67,